      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Today, we’re announcing the next frontier model: Gemini 4 Carbon, our strongest model with state-of-the-art cybersecurity and long horizon capabilities.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/gemini-4-carbon-our-next-frontier-model/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T17:00:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:24.298Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Building on Gemini 4 Argon , which was launched two weeks ago, Carbon illustrates the pace at which we’re pushing the frontier forward.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/gemini-4-carbon-our-next-frontier-model/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T17:00:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:24.298Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Gemini 4 Carbon will launch at the same introductory price",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/gemini-4-carbon-our-next-frontier-model/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T17:00:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:24.298Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "As another example, the Chrome team has reported that Carbon performed more than 10X better than another lab's large frontier model when generating high quality patches.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://deepmind.google/blog/gemini-4-carbon-our-next-frontier-model/",
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T17:00:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:24.298Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Gemini 4 Carbon builds on the same multi-layered safety and security stack of Argon — combining model training, real-time misuse defenses, prompt-injection resilience, and chain-of-thought monitoring.",
